    Predict magnitude spectrum $\vs_\text{F}$ \\
    $\Ls_\text{spec} \gets -\log \mathcal{N}\left(\mathrm{vec}(\vz_\text{r}); \bm{0}, \diag(\vs_\text{F})^2\right)$ \tcp*{Eq.~(\ref{eq:specloss})}
